[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H     \u001b[2m 282 \u001b[12G\u001b[22mprints `gate passed: the\u001b[37Ginputs\u001b[44Gare\u001b[48Gthose\u001b[54Gof\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[61Ggate\u001b[66Gpassed\u001b[73G<time>`\u001b[81Gand\u001b[85Gexits\u001b[91G0\u001b[93Gat\u001b[96Gonce,\u001b[102Gso\u001b[105Ga\u001b[107Gcommit\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m3\u001b[12G\u001b[22mof documentation, or a second run before a\u001b[55Gcommit,\u001b[63Gcos\u001b[67Gs nothing; `--force` runs\u001b[93Git anyway. CI's\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 284 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mcheckout has no `build/gate-passed`, so it always runs.                                               \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 284 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mcheckout has no `build/gate-passed`, so it always runs.\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m The one check of the `*.md`, their links\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 285 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mbetween the repository's files and to their headings (`lychee --offline --include-fragments`),        \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m6\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mruns before that, on every run, failing\u001b[52Gthe gate on a broken one; it takes under a second.      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 287 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 288 \u001b[22m ```bash\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m9\u001b[12G\u001b[22m./scripts/ci.sh\u001b[28G--werror\u001b[37G--asan\u001b[44G--log\u001b[50Gbuild/gate.log\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe link check finds no\u001b[27Gbroken\u001b[34Glinks\u001b[40Gacross\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51G22\u001b[54GMarkdown\u001b[63Gfiles,\u001b[70Gand\u001b[74Gshellcheck\u001b[85Greports\u001b[93Gnothing\u001b[101Gin\u001b[104Geither\u001b[111Gscript.\r\u001b[2C