[0.229, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mI restarted you\u001b[39m                                                                                                       \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe restart stopped the\u001b[27Gprevious\u001b[36Ggate\u001b[41Gpartway\u001b[49Gthrough\u001b[57Gits\u001b[61Gunit\u001b[66Gtests.\u001b[73GNothing\u001b[81Gis\u001b[84Grunning\u001b[92Gnow\u001b[96Gand\u001b[100G54\u001b[103GGiB\u001b[107Gis\u001b[110Gfree,\u001b[116Gso\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI'm\u001b[7Grunning\u001b[15Gthe\u001b[19Ggate\u001b[24Gagain.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mDoes the script you wrote remind me to exit the asciinema shell once I exit claude? I think a one line reminder to \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mCTRL-D out of that shell would be very useful.\u001b[39m                                                                        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m The script's \u001b[38;2;177;185;249masciinema rec\u001b[39m command ends the recording when Claude Code exits, so Ctrl-D isn't needed. I'll report when\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe\u001b[7Ggate\u001b[12Gfinishes.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning ./script\u001b[20G/ci.sh --werror\u001b[36G--asan\u001b[43G--log\u001b[49Gbuild/gate.…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ ./scripts/ci.sh --werror --asan --log build/gate.log (3m 1s · 14 lines)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ When does the script and asciinema create the save folder and files? I can't see that folder in my project yet.\u001b[39m       \r\u001b[2C\u001b[5B\u001b[49m\u001b[2mPress up to edit queued messages\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[37C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent · ↓ to manage\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
